# Horizon's foundation uses no application environment variables in shipped builds, apart from the test-only update feed below.
# Development builds only: point the importers at synthetic browser folders instead of the real ones.
# HORIZON_IMPORT_LOCALAPPDATA=
# HORIZON_IMPORT_APPDATA=
# Packaged builds, tests only: read updates from a local feed. Only http on 127.0.0.1 or localhost is accepted.
# HORIZON_UPDATE_URL=
